"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The US has announced new sanctions on Iran, calling it an 'economic D-Day'. Iran says it has a plan to deal with these sanctions.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Sanctions on Iran\",            \"translated_version\": \"Estados Unidos ha anunciado nuevas sanciones a Ir\u00e1n, llam\u00e1ndolo un `D\u00eda D econ\u00f3mico`. Ir\u00e1n dice que tiene un plan para manejar estas sanciones.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Sanciones de EE.UU. a Ir\u00e1n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Moscow has warned of consequences after reports that Ukraine used British drones.\",            \"english_title\": \"Moscow Warns Ukraine\",            \"translated_version\": \"Mosc\u00fa ha advertido de consecuencias despu\u00e9s de informes de que Ucrania us\u00f3 drones brit\u00e1nicos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Mosc\u00fa advierte a Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A tornado has injured more than 40 people and destroyed homes in villages.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tornado Causes Damage\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un tornado ha herido a m\u00e1s de 40 personas y destruido casas en pueblos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tornado causa da\u00f1o\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"US President Donald Trump has proposed new 50% tariffs on Canadian vehicles as the trade dispute between the two countries grows.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Tariffs on Canada\",            \"translated_version\": \"El presidente de EE.UU., Donald Trump, ha propuesto nuevos aranceles del 50% a los veh\u00edculos canadienses mientras la disputa comercial entre los dos pa\u00edses crece.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Aranceles de EE.UU. a Canad\u00e1\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Norway's King Harald is in the hospital receiving antibiotics for a bacterial infection in his bloodstream.\",            \"english_title\": \"King Harald in Hospital\",            \"translated_version\": \"El rey Harald de Noruega est\u00e1 en el hospital recibiendo antibi\u00f3ticos por una infecci\u00f3n bacteriana en su sangre.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Rey Harald en el hospital\"        }    ]}"